WEBVTT

00:03.006 --> 00:05.385
SKY FORTRESS DAMOCLES

00:05.469 --> 00:07.974
[Divock]
Open a private line to Lady Narah.

00:08.058 --> 00:09.101
[controller] Roger that.

00:09.352 --> 00:10.354
Opening line now.

00:10.437 --> 00:11.481
DAMOCLES COMMAND ROOM

00:12.233 --> 00:13.485
My apologies.

00:13.569 --> 00:15.489
[Divock] <i>Normally, it should be you,</i>

00:15.782 --> 00:18.913
<i>the Schwarz Queen,
rather than me leading this operation.</i>

00:19.665 --> 00:21.000
Think nothing of it.

00:21.084 --> 00:22.921
Those were Lord Norland's orders.

00:23.004 --> 00:26.094
My unit will focus on suppressing
the enemy's ground forces.

00:26.720 --> 00:30.143
That will allow me to concentrate
on the operation of the <i>Damocles</i>.

00:30.227 --> 00:34.736
Leave the extermination of the Elevens
in the Sapporo Ghetto to me.

00:36.239 --> 00:38.953
<i>Extermination? Of unarmed civilians?</i>

00:39.871 --> 00:41.457
SEVEN SHINING STARS HAKODATE HIDEOUT

00:41.542 --> 00:42.836
[Rozé] We've received enemy intel.

00:43.420 --> 00:46.426
The <i>Damocles</i> is scheduled
to arrive in Sapporo at 18:00.

00:46.927 --> 00:49.975
We'll intercept with both ground
and infiltration forces.

00:50.058 --> 00:52.438
The dispatched enemy units
are Narah Vaughn

00:52.522 --> 00:54.025
and Divock Merte's two squads.

00:54.442 --> 00:56.697
[Rozé] Check the documents
for their detailed numbers.

00:57.114 --> 00:59.870
Even with just two squads,
they're way superior to us.

01:00.120 --> 01:03.168
[Rozé] Better than facing
the entire Neo-Britannian army.

01:03.251 --> 01:04.546
True.

01:04.629 --> 01:06.132
How did we get this intel?

01:06.675 --> 01:09.305
One must always have
collaborators on standby.

01:09.973 --> 01:13.396
According to the intel,
Divock is guarding the <i>Damocles</i>.

01:13.480 --> 01:15.902
Narah is in charge of the ground forces.

01:16.235 --> 01:17.989
I'll take on Narah.

01:18.281 --> 01:19.618
[Ash] She's strong.

01:20.118 --> 01:22.456
I have a more important mission
for you, Ash.

01:23.542 --> 01:26.172
[Rozé] We'll send formation details
to each unit leader

01:26.255 --> 01:28.426
after conferring with General Kuroto.

01:29.303 --> 01:33.019
Now, let's save the Japanese
from the clutches of Neo-Britannia

01:33.729 --> 01:35.399
<i>and make heroes of ourselves!</i>

01:38.029 --> 01:40.033
[♪ opening theme song playing]

03:11.173 --> 03:14.013
You're sure they only have
three F.L.E.I.J.A.s left?

03:14.096 --> 03:15.140
<i>Yes.</i>

03:15.223 --> 03:18.354
<i>F.L.E.I.J.A.s can only be manufactured
using specialized equipment.</i>

03:19.189 --> 03:23.741
[Nina] <i>Prime Minister Schneizel
took all the ones we made at the time.</i>

03:24.618 --> 03:28.124
<i>I've reviewed the records
multiple times just to be sure.</i>

03:29.043 --> 03:32.215
There may be fewer than three,
but no more.

03:32.634 --> 03:33.844
Got it.

03:33.927 --> 03:37.434
Ms. Sakai, please tell General Kuroto
that everything's going as planned.

03:37.518 --> 03:38.520
[Sakai] <i>Understood.</i>

03:38.604 --> 03:40.691
-Rozé.
-Oh?

03:44.198 --> 03:45.785
Hey there!

03:45.868 --> 03:48.122
We're with the transport service
that was requested.

03:48.206 --> 03:50.460
Military orders are for us to evacuate

03:50.544 --> 03:51.672
the Britannians inside.

03:51.755 --> 03:55.011
[guard] This area is strictly off-limits.
Turn around.

03:55.721 --> 03:57.432
What is it?

03:58.519 --> 03:59.604
[chimes]

03:59.854 --> 04:01.817
[Sakuya] Rescue the Japanese.

04:02.568 --> 04:04.405
Assist Rozé.

04:07.745 --> 04:08.872
Very well.

04:09.749 --> 04:11.545
Another one of your collaborators?

04:11.628 --> 04:13.423
We don't usually meet in person,

04:13.507 --> 04:16.137
so there's a password for times like this.

04:16.888 --> 04:18.976
Can't believe you set this all up.

04:19.476 --> 04:21.188
You're really something else.

04:21.690 --> 04:26.323
[Rozé] Now, let's get the soldiers inside
to help evacuate the Japanese too.

04:26.783 --> 04:28.161
NEO-BRITANNIA GOVERNMENT OFFICE
FRONT SHRINE

04:28.244 --> 04:29.246
[Sakura] Norland.

04:29.581 --> 04:32.670
Destroying the Sapporo Ghetto
is pointless.

04:32.754 --> 04:34.214
Stop it immediately.

04:34.632 --> 04:37.095
[Norland] Is that why
you summoned me here?

04:37.722 --> 04:41.145
[Sakura] You may justify such actions
as eliminating terrorists.

04:41.646 --> 04:46.740
However, if innocent civilians die,
we'll face international criticism.

04:47.199 --> 04:49.077
That would jeopardize
this country's future--

04:49.203 --> 04:51.666
I have noted your opinion.
Now, if you'll excuse me.

04:52.960 --> 04:54.923
Wait. We're not done here...

04:56.008 --> 04:57.553
[Sakura whimpers]

04:59.974 --> 05:03.272
I really am powerless after all.

05:05.109 --> 05:06.195
All I can do now

05:07.030 --> 05:08.909
<i>is pray...</i>

05:11.247 --> 05:13.752
[controller] Our external cameras
have captured the Sapporo Ghetto.

05:14.044 --> 05:17.552
[soldier] Multiple heat sources detected.
Transmitting data.

05:19.221 --> 05:21.433
[scoffs] Damn terrorists.

05:21.518 --> 05:23.605
I'll wipe you off the face of the planet.

05:24.022 --> 05:25.275
Prepare to fire!

05:25.693 --> 05:27.947
[controller] Stopping outside enemy range.

05:28.740 --> 05:30.703
[controller B] Partially deactivating
Blaze Luminous.

05:33.040 --> 05:34.293
[soldier] Search complete.

05:35.128 --> 05:38.009
[Yoko] <i>Blaze Luminous
has been partially deactivated.</i>

05:38.259 --> 05:40.013
[Kuroto] <i>Prepare full-scale attack.</i>

05:40.598 --> 05:41.892
[Divock] <i>Sweepers on standby.</i>

05:43.812 --> 05:45.816
SAPPORO GHETTO

05:48.864 --> 05:50.033
Fire!

05:50.491 --> 05:51.493
Attack.

05:57.757 --> 05:59.343
[Iwamoto] <i>Fire! Fire!</i>

06:00.178 --> 06:02.390
Keep firing until you're out of ammo!

06:06.106 --> 06:07.735
-[Damocles rumbles]
-[Divock grunts]

06:07.818 --> 06:09.237
Recall the sweepers.

06:09.321 --> 06:10.783
Reactivate Blaze Luminous!

06:10.866 --> 06:12.202
Reactivating Blaze Luminous!

06:14.624 --> 06:17.420
[Iwamoto] <i>All right, that's enough!
Fall back!</i>

06:17.880 --> 06:20.176
[Divock] <i>Lady Narah, requesting pursuit.</i>

06:20.260 --> 06:22.472
[Narah] Roger that!
Time to hunt down those rats.

06:22.640 --> 06:24.602
<i>Don't let them set off any more fireworks!</i>

06:38.212 --> 06:40.843
[soldier] Enemy is pulling back
from the front lines.

06:41.135 --> 06:43.807
[Divock] Good.
Resume relocation of the <i>Damocles</i>.

06:43.890 --> 06:45.101
[controller] Resuming relocation.

06:45.853 --> 06:49.192
If we keep up this pace,
this should all be over by sunset.

06:49.276 --> 06:51.321
-[alarm beeping]
-[soldier] Incoming units from the rear!

06:51.405 --> 06:52.490
Six in total!

06:55.539 --> 06:58.169
The North Wolf Army
has drawn away the ground units!

06:58.419 --> 07:00.883
Time to attack the main target!

07:01.843 --> 07:04.724
[scoffs] As if they posed any threat.

07:05.224 --> 07:10.234
The Black Knights have completed
a new F.L.E.I.J.A. Eliminator,

07:10.318 --> 07:12.573
as well as countermeasures
against the Blaze Luminous!

07:15.954 --> 07:16.956
Follow me!

07:19.127 --> 07:21.549
-[alarm blaring]
-Blaze Luminous partially disabled.

07:21.633 --> 07:23.094
Two seconds until reactivation.

07:24.764 --> 07:25.766
[growls]

07:25.849 --> 07:28.229
[soldier] Enemy units
have breached our shields!

07:28.312 --> 07:30.274
Deploy the Knightmares!

07:30.358 --> 07:31.861
Eliminate the intruders!

07:31.945 --> 07:33.239
I'll go myself!

07:34.449 --> 07:35.493
[Rozé] <i>Let me repeat.</i>

07:35.577 --> 07:38.290
We must destroy three of the four floats,

07:38.374 --> 07:40.796
or they'll escape to high altitudes,
leaving us helpless.

07:40.879 --> 07:43.342
<i>Please ensure the armor-piercing bombs
are planted.</i>

07:43.969 --> 07:45.012
Leave it to me.

07:45.429 --> 07:47.768
[Rozé] <i>I'll work
on capturing the</i> Damocles <i>.</i>

07:48.310 --> 07:51.985
Haruka, support the infiltration
and provide cover for everyone.

07:52.068 --> 07:53.070
Understood.

07:53.572 --> 07:55.826
[Rozé] <i>All right, then.
Commence operation!</i>

07:55.909 --> 07:56.911
[all] Roger!

08:00.961 --> 08:02.380
[Rozé] <i>Thanks, Haruka!</i>

08:08.602 --> 08:10.271
Now then...

08:19.080 --> 08:20.208
[Iwamoto] <i>Nakahashi!</i>

08:21.502 --> 08:26.094
We'll be wiped out at this rate.
All Knightmares, disperse and retreat!

08:26.763 --> 08:27.973
[Narah] Fools.

08:28.307 --> 08:30.478
Spreading out your already limited forces

08:30.812 --> 08:32.733
will only make you easy prey for us.

08:40.749 --> 08:41.918
-[grunts]
-[alarm beeping]

08:42.001 --> 08:43.797
Uto... Huh?

08:54.276 --> 08:55.654
Don't pursue 'em too far.

08:56.071 --> 08:57.533
[Kuroto] Apologies for the delay.

08:58.284 --> 09:00.872
North Wolf Army,
please fall back to a safe zone.

09:01.248 --> 09:03.503
[Kuroto] <i>We'll take it from here.</i>

09:03.628 --> 09:04.797
[Iwamoto] <i>Roger that!</i>

09:07.051 --> 09:09.264
[Oda] <i>The life of the party has arrived!</i>

09:09.347 --> 09:11.059
[yells]

09:15.777 --> 09:17.573
Turret Charlie, move out.

09:19.409 --> 09:20.411
[Kuroto] <i>Fire.</i>

09:21.873 --> 09:24.670
<i>Monobe squad,
drive them straight to Delta Point.</i>

09:24.754 --> 09:25.839
[Isao] Roger that.

09:26.173 --> 09:27.342
Fire!

09:29.262 --> 09:31.308
[Kuroto] <i>Delta Point,
ready armor-piercing bombs.</i>

09:31.391 --> 09:32.477
Detonate!

09:33.187 --> 09:36.026
[Kuroto] <i>Munemori squad,
drive them to Alpha Point.</i>

09:38.740 --> 09:41.286
[soldier] <i>Lady Narah!
The enemy forces are pushing us back!</i>

09:42.163 --> 09:43.248
[Narah] <i>Remain calm!</i>

09:43.332 --> 09:45.044
<i>Redirect rear units to provide support.</i>

09:45.127 --> 09:47.006
<i>Then regroup and push back the front line.</i>

09:47.090 --> 09:48.092
[soldier] <i>Understood!</i>

09:48.635 --> 09:51.098
[Narah] <i>Turning their ally's mistake
into an advantage?</i>

09:53.603 --> 09:55.064
<i>Impressive.</i>

09:55.649 --> 09:58.780
Araki, what's the status
of the <i>Damocles</i>'s setup?

09:58.863 --> 10:01.911
[Yoko] <i>The first and third wing squads
have completed their setup.</i>

10:01.994 --> 10:04.165
<i>The second wing squad has been destroyed.</i>

10:04.917 --> 10:07.171
<i>The fourth wing squad
is currently setting up.</i>

10:07.881 --> 10:09.885
[soldier] <i>All that's left is to set up
Commander Tomi's--</i>

10:13.142 --> 10:17.316
[Divock] <i>You filthy monkeys
dare step onto the</i> Damocles <i>?</i>

10:17.400 --> 10:18.820
<i>For this crime,</i>

10:19.070 --> 10:21.116
you'll pay with your lives!

10:22.034 --> 10:24.540
[scoffs] The enemy commander himself, huh?

10:25.499 --> 10:27.128
Thanks for coming!

10:28.715 --> 10:31.094
[Rozé] Backdoor secured.

10:31.762 --> 10:32.890
As for the F.L.E.I.J.A.s...

10:33.432 --> 10:35.436
-There are two left...
-[knock on door]

10:35.520 --> 10:37.023
-[gasps]
-[soldier] Hey, open up!

10:39.570 --> 10:41.741
[soldier] Hey!
What the hell are you doing?

10:41.824 --> 10:43.327
Disable the override command!

10:43.620 --> 10:44.997
It'll interfere with navigation.

10:45.498 --> 10:47.878
It is to prevent us from gaining
any further altitude.

10:47.961 --> 10:50.132
You received no such orders!

10:50.216 --> 10:52.930
[controller C] The orders I have received
are absolute.

10:53.973 --> 10:56.729
-[gunshot]
-Kill anyone who behaves suspiciously,

10:56.813 --> 10:57.981
including allies!

10:58.065 --> 10:59.860
Shoot down anyone who refuses to stop!

10:59.944 --> 11:01.531
These are Lord Norland's orders.

11:04.537 --> 11:05.539
[Rozé] <i>This is bad.</i>

11:05.622 --> 11:08.628
<i>We've lost our chance of capturing
the</i> Damocles <i>from the inside.</i>

11:12.678 --> 11:13.805
[Tomi] <i>No!</i>

11:14.807 --> 11:18.606
[scoffs] Looks like your bravado
didn't last very long.

11:21.862 --> 11:22.990
Dammit!

11:24.284 --> 11:25.286
[Divock] <i>Now...</i>

11:26.454 --> 11:27.708
-Time to die--
-[metal crunches]

11:30.129 --> 11:32.300
[Haruka] <i>Sorry for the delay.</i>

11:32.593 --> 11:34.304
I'll handle this one.

11:35.599 --> 11:36.726
[Divock] <i>A new model?</i>

11:37.435 --> 11:41.026
Doesn't matter what a monkey rides.
It'll end up the same way!

11:44.365 --> 11:45.451
All right, then.

11:46.328 --> 11:47.581
<i>Let's put that to the test!</i>

12:00.064 --> 12:02.151
It moves just the way I want it to!

12:03.236 --> 12:05.449
[Haruka] <i>I can do this!</i>

12:13.758 --> 12:14.885
Damn it.

12:14.969 --> 12:15.970
[soldier] <i>Lord Divock.</i>

12:16.681 --> 12:18.685
<i>We are within
the F.L.E.I.J.A.'s effective range.</i>

12:18.810 --> 12:21.398
-Good, prepare to fire.
<i>-Roger that.</i>

12:24.112 --> 12:26.157
The enemy boss fled. Should I pursue?

12:26.241 --> 12:28.746
[Rozé] <i>Hold on. General Kuroto,
what are the enemy's movements?</i>

12:29.497 --> 12:31.544
[Kuroto]
They're pulling back from the front lines.

12:32.002 --> 12:33.798
Are they preparing
to use the F.L.E.I.J.A.?

12:34.132 --> 12:35.927
[Rozé] <i>They're moving faster
than expected.</i>

12:36.010 --> 12:37.806
<i>We need to stop them at all costs.</i>

12:38.181 --> 12:40.770
First and third wings,
prepare to detonate.

12:40.854 --> 12:42.314
[Tsutsuya] Preparing to detonate.

12:42.816 --> 12:45.989
[Kuroto] <i>Haruka squad, Tomi squad,
first and third wing squads,</i>

12:46.072 --> 12:47.283
<i>evacuate immediately.</i>

12:47.366 --> 12:48.368
[all] <i>Roger that!</i>

12:48.745 --> 12:50.247
[Divock] Is the F.L.E.I.J.A. ready?

12:50.582 --> 12:53.128
[soldier] It is past critical threshold.
Ready to fire.

12:53.462 --> 12:55.215
Estimated effect at current levels?

12:55.299 --> 12:56.719
[soldier] About 20%.

12:57.219 --> 13:00.852
The monkeys may have interfered,
but there's no need to rush.

13:01.352 --> 13:02.939
[Rozé] <i>General Kuroto, we're good to go.</i>

13:03.356 --> 13:05.194
Detonate armor-piercing bombs!

13:05.277 --> 13:06.279
[Tsutsuya] Detonating.

13:08.325 --> 13:09.578
-[Damocles rumbles]
-[alarm blares]

13:09.661 --> 13:10.663
[Divock] Status!

13:10.747 --> 13:13.418
[soldier] The front and rear floats
have been disabled by the explosion.

13:13.544 --> 13:15.507
Total output is now at 50%.

13:15.840 --> 13:18.846
Increase output
of left and right wings to 150%.

13:18.930 --> 13:19.932
[soldier] Yes, sir!

13:20.015 --> 13:22.436
Then proceed with firing the F.L.E.I.J.A.

13:22.521 --> 13:24.525
[soldier] We won't achieve
the maximum effect.

13:24.608 --> 13:27.279
[Divock] No matter.
We still have one more shot. Fire!

13:27.864 --> 13:29.117
[soldier] Firing the F.L.E.I.J.A.!

13:30.829 --> 13:32.331
[both gasp]

13:33.125 --> 13:35.588
[Rozé] <i>Ash! It's heading your way!</i>

13:37.424 --> 13:38.553
Leave it to me!

13:56.922 --> 13:58.091
[Ash] <i>Is it over?</i>

13:58.593 --> 14:01.347
[Rozé] <i>No, there's still one left.</i>

14:03.978 --> 14:04.980
<i>Ms. Nina.</i>

14:05.063 --> 14:07.819
<i>Please prepare
the F.L.E.I.J.A. Eliminator.</i>

14:08.361 --> 14:09.363
Understood.

14:10.032 --> 14:12.829
Though honestly,
I'm not sure if we'll make it in time...

14:15.042 --> 14:16.545
[Divock] Get the F.L.E.I.J.A. ready!

14:17.129 --> 14:18.799
[soldier] Activating the F.L.E.I.J.A.

14:19.342 --> 14:23.183
This time,
I'll make sure it hits dead center.

14:24.185 --> 14:26.481
[Ishikawa] <i>We've analyzed the data
from the last F.L.E.I.J.A.</i>

14:26.857 --> 14:29.905
<i>If the same model
is fired across the Ishikari River,</i>

14:29.988 --> 14:32.493
<i>the rate of damage will exceed 70%.</i>

14:32.786 --> 14:36.042
Oda squad, Munemori squad,
rendezvous in front of the Ishikari River.

14:36.125 --> 14:39.048
Monobe squad, Iwamoto squad,
deploy within Ebetsu city.

14:39.131 --> 14:40.133
[all] <i>Roger that.</i>

14:40.217 --> 14:41.219
[Oda] <i>Roger!</i>

14:42.096 --> 14:44.016
We're too far away to make it.

14:44.475 --> 14:45.477
[Haruka] <i>What about us?</i>

14:45.561 --> 14:47.691
[Kuroto] <i>Support the ground forces.</i>

14:47.774 --> 14:48.776
[Haruka] <i>Roger that.</i>

14:51.615 --> 14:53.368
[Tomi] <i>Am I completely useless?</i>

14:54.286 --> 14:56.332
<i>No... I can still fight.</i>

15:00.967 --> 15:01.969
Commander Tomi?

15:02.052 --> 15:04.725
-[Tomi] <i>I'm taking out the floats!</i>
-What?

15:05.560 --> 15:07.021
[Tomi] <i>I'll manage with the VTOL,</i>

15:07.104 --> 15:10.110
<i>plus the Sekka and
the armor-piercing bombs left behind.</i>

15:10.193 --> 15:11.195
That's insane!

15:11.697 --> 15:13.074
[Tomi] I'm well aware of that!

15:13.158 --> 15:17.667
But a hero who can't fight
isn't worth his salt!

15:17.834 --> 15:20.590
-[alarm beeping]
-[soldier] Enemy VTOL closing in fast!

15:20.757 --> 15:23.428
[scoffs] Activate our Blaze Luminous!

15:23.512 --> 15:25.516
[soldier] All energy is currently
allocated to flight.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.394
-We cannot activate it.
-Reroute power!

15:27.478 --> 15:28.731
[soldier] There isn't enough time!

15:33.991 --> 15:35.828
[Tsutsuya] Fourth wing,
explosion confirmed.

15:36.454 --> 15:39.418
[Yoko] We've lost Commander Tomi's signal.

15:40.003 --> 15:41.005
[Kuroto] I see...

15:45.556 --> 15:47.727
-[alarm blaring]
-[soldier 1] Left wing float disabled!

15:47.811 --> 15:50.608
Navigational speed reduced to 25%.

15:50.858 --> 15:53.446
[soldier 2]
Blaze Luminous generator is unresponsive!

15:53.531 --> 15:56.745
[soldier 3] The F.L.E.I.J.A. is past
critical threshold. Ready to fire!

15:57.037 --> 15:58.414
No, not yet!

15:59.166 --> 16:01.922
Our next target has to be
the center of Sapporo...

16:02.422 --> 16:03.424
[controller] Yes, sir!

16:04.719 --> 16:06.305
[Divock] <i>If push comes to shove...</i>

16:09.103 --> 16:11.190
[Ishikawa] <i>They're approaching
our last line of defense.</i>

16:11.817 --> 16:15.157
Rozé, are we set
on destroying the <i>Damocles</i>?

16:15.240 --> 16:16.325
[Rozé] Yes.

16:16.409 --> 16:18.246
We've abandoned the plan to capture it.

16:18.329 --> 16:20.417
They still have one F.L.E.I.J.A. left.

16:20.500 --> 16:21.753
I'll join up as well.

16:22.922 --> 16:24.593
It's the Schwarz Queen.

16:24.676 --> 16:26.429
Oda squad, intercept her.

16:26.513 --> 16:29.226
[Oda] <i>Seriously? I mean, roger that!</i>

16:36.992 --> 16:39.496
-Not bad for a ragtag group.
-[alarm beeping]

16:52.231 --> 16:53.483
It's him...

16:57.159 --> 16:58.243
[Scissorman exclaims]

16:58.326 --> 17:03.044
Gotta say, I've no idea what's going on
in that head of yours...

17:05.131 --> 17:06.677
[Norland scoffs]

17:12.437 --> 17:14.734
[Tsutsuya] <i>The</i> Damocles <i>is crossing
the Ishikari River.</i>

17:14.818 --> 17:16.822
[Ishikawa] <i>The bottom of the target
is heavily damaged!</i>

17:16.905 --> 17:18.951
<i>It's unlikely it can fire the F.L.E.I.J.A.</i>

17:19.034 --> 17:20.036
[Kuroto] <i>Good.</i>

17:20.120 --> 17:23.961
<i>Oda squad, Munemori squad, deploy from
the New Ishikari Bridge to Ebetsu.</i>

17:24.003 --> 17:25.005
[all] <i>Roger that!</i>

17:25.548 --> 17:27.635
[Narah] Are you the infamous mercenary?

17:27.969 --> 17:30.015
The one who killed Gran and Arnold!

17:35.735 --> 17:36.945
[gasps]

17:45.630 --> 17:47.717
That move. It can't be...

17:47.800 --> 17:49.178
Is the pilot of that Knightmare--

17:49.261 --> 17:51.390
[soldier] <i>Lady Narah,
the enemy is approaching from behind!</i>

17:52.685 --> 17:54.939
<i>It appears to be the squad
that breached the</i> Damocles <i>.</i>

17:55.398 --> 17:56.902
<i>We'll be flanked at this rate!</i>

17:58.906 --> 18:00.492
[Narah] This is the end of the road...

18:01.202 --> 18:02.204
<i>Retreat!</i>

18:05.878 --> 18:08.383
Retreat? What are you talking about?

18:08.801 --> 18:10.095
You've got to be kidding!

18:10.178 --> 18:11.973
Get back there and fulfill your duty!

18:12.057 --> 18:13.059
[Narah] <i>My duty?</i>

18:13.769 --> 18:15.271
The mission has failed.

18:15.355 --> 18:17.442
There is no point in further combat.

18:18.403 --> 18:19.531
Failed...?

18:19.948 --> 18:22.452
[Narah] <i>Do you expect me to sacrifice
my unit for a dying</i> Damocles

18:22.537 --> 18:24.498
<i>that can no longer even use
its F.L.E.I.J.A?</i>

18:24.624 --> 18:26.293
But... I--

18:27.588 --> 18:29.466
<i>Hey there, Little Miss Narah.</i>

18:32.180 --> 18:34.143
[Divock] How dare you underestimate me...

18:34.644 --> 18:37.023
Scum! Scum! Scum!

18:37.107 --> 18:38.819
[Divock grumbles]

18:43.244 --> 18:45.666
Enemy ground forces are retreating...

18:46.500 --> 18:47.503
We've won!

18:47.587 --> 18:49.465
We've actually won, General Kuroto!

18:49.591 --> 18:52.847
[sighs] It's still too early to tell.

18:52.972 --> 18:53.974
[alarm beeping]

18:54.057 --> 18:57.105
Detecting an object flying
from the <i>Damocles</i> at high speed!

18:57.189 --> 18:58.483
Its target is...

18:58.901 --> 19:00.361
the Sapporo Ghetto!

19:02.407 --> 19:03.744
Damn you, scum...

19:03.869 --> 19:07.209
At this rate,
I'll be blamed for this defeat.

19:08.127 --> 19:11.383
[Divock] <i>Lord Norland is not one to
forgive the failures of his subordinates!</i>

19:11.467 --> 19:14.516
So I'm taking all of you down with me!

19:15.058 --> 19:17.605
The enemy Knightmare
is carrying the F.L.E.I.J.A.!

19:17.688 --> 19:18.690
What?

19:18.774 --> 19:19.943
[Isao] Should we shoot it down?

19:20.026 --> 19:22.782
<i>No! The F.L.E.I.J.A.
is already past critical threshold.</i>

19:22.865 --> 19:24.619
<i>Any disturbance will cause it to explode!</i>

19:26.080 --> 19:27.207
[Iwamoto] What?!

19:28.334 --> 19:29.294
[Rozé] Ash!

19:30.171 --> 19:31.340
Let's stop that thing.

19:31.716 --> 19:34.137
With the Apollo and Artemis,
we still have a chance.

19:34.429 --> 19:36.308
[Ash] <i>Right... The Ortygia...</i>

19:36.392 --> 19:38.187
<i>But without the F.L.E.I.J.A. Eliminator...</i>

19:38.271 --> 19:40.149
[Rozé] <i>Don't worry, I've brought it.</i>

19:41.110 --> 19:42.112
Well, then.

19:42.195 --> 19:43.907
[Rozé] <i>I'll let you
handle the controls, Ash!</i>

19:44.324 --> 19:46.412
Yes, leave it to me!

19:47.999 --> 19:49.669
What are they planning?

19:52.382 --> 19:53.426
Engage!

20:18.685 --> 20:21.691
Zi-Ortygia, successfully docked!

20:25.824 --> 20:26.826
Let's do this!

20:28.412 --> 20:29.874
[straining]

20:40.436 --> 20:42.232
-[alarm beeping]
-What?!

20:47.117 --> 20:49.162
Worthless scum!

21:05.654 --> 21:08.451
-[Divock screams]
-[metal crunching]

21:17.845 --> 21:19.139
F.L.E.I.J.A. neutralized.

21:19.389 --> 21:21.477
[all cheering]

21:21.561 --> 21:22.563
[man 1] They did it!

21:22.646 --> 21:23.857
[man 2] Hell yeah!

21:29.451 --> 21:30.453
[sighs in relief]

21:31.623 --> 21:32.708
[gasps]

21:40.557 --> 21:42.603
-What?
-No way!

21:48.907 --> 21:52.915
[Scissorman] What a use
of the final F.L.E.I.J.A...

21:53.249 --> 21:54.794
[clicks tongue]

21:55.963 --> 21:59.261
[Scissorman] A flashier tombstone
than they deserve.

22:01.181 --> 22:03.060
Call it a souvenir of the afterlife.

22:04.856 --> 22:06.108
Take it to your graves.

22:08.404 --> 22:09.740
[Narah] <i>Could it be...</i>

22:09.824 --> 22:13.247
<i>that they planned on discarding
the</i> Damocles <i>from the start...?</i>

22:14.416 --> 22:15.794
<i>Unbelievable...</i>

22:19.802 --> 22:20.804
[Oda] <i>Hey.</i>

22:21.639 --> 22:23.434
This situation...

22:24.060 --> 22:25.313
is looking pretty grim.

22:27.400 --> 22:30.364
[Shota] The <i>Damocles</i>... is about to...

22:32.828 --> 22:35.333
Rain down... on us...

22:38.380 --> 22:40.384
[♪ closing theme song playing]

24:05.889 --> 24:07.893
Translated by Kenji Mouri
